"List of countries by military expenditures\")) |\n| [Percent of GDP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gross_domestic_product \"Gross domestic product\") | 1.7% (2024)[[3]](#cite_note-SIPRI-2020-3) |\n| [Industry](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_acquisition \"Military acquisition\") | |\n| Domestic suppliers | * [China National Aero-Technology Import & Export Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_National_Aero-Technology_Import_&_Export_Corporation \"China National Aero-Technology Import & Export Corporation\") * [China Electronics Technology Group](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_Electronics_Technology_Group \"China Electronics Technology Group\") * [Norinco](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norinco \"Norinco\") * [China Precision Machinery Import-Export Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_Precision_Machinery_Import-Export_Corporation \"China Precision Machinery Import-Export Corporation\") * [Aviation Industry Corporation of China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aviation_Industry_Corporation_of_China \"Aviation Industry Corporation of China\") * [China State Shipbuilding Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_State_Shipbuilding_Corporation \"China State Shipbuilding Corporation\") * [China Shipbuilding Industry Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_Shipbuilding_Industry_Corporation \"China Shipbuilding Industry Corporation\") * [China Aerospace Science and Technology Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_Aerospace_Science_and_Technology_Corporation \"China Aerospace Science and Technology Corporation\") * [China Aerospace Science and Industry Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_Aerospace_Science_and_Industry_Corporation \"China Aerospace Science and Industry Corporation\") * [China South Industries Group Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_South_Industries_Group_Corporation \"China South Industries Group Corporation\") * [China Electronics Technology Group](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_Electronics_Technology_Group \"China Electronics Technology Group\") * [China National Nuclear Corporation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China_National_Nuclear_Corporation \"China National Nuclear Corporation\") |\n| Foreign suppliers | * [Russia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russia \"Russia\") Historical:  * [Soviet Union](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Union \"Soviet Union\")[[4]](#cite_note-4) |\n| Annual imports | $14.858 billion (2010–2021)[[5]](#cite_note-SIPRI-5) |\n| Annual exports | $18.121 billion (2010–2021)[[5]](#cite_note-SIPRI-5) |\n| Related articles | |\n| History | * [History of the PLA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_People's_Liberation_Army \"History of the People's Liberation Army\") * [Modernization of the PLA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modernization_of_the_People's_Liberation_Army \"Modernization of the People's Liberation Army\") * [Historical Chinese wars and battles](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chinese_wars_and_battles \"List of Chinese wars and battles\") * [Military engagements](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_wars_involving_the_People's_Republic_of_China \"List of wars involving the People's Republic of China\") |\n| [Ranks](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_rank \"Military rank\") | * [Army ranks](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ranks_of_the_People's_Liberation_Army_Ground_Force \"Ranks of the People's Liberation Army Ground Force\") * [Navy ranks](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ranks_of_the_People's_Liberation_Army_Navy \"Ranks of the People's Liberation Army Navy\") * [Air force ranks](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ranks_of_the_People's_Liberation_Army_Air_Force \"Ranks of the People's Liberation Army Air Force\") |\n\n| Chinese People's Liberation Army | |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Simplified Chinese](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters \"Simplified Chinese characters\") | 中国人民解放军 |\n| [Traditional Chinese](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters \"Traditional Chinese characters\") | 中國人民解放軍 |\n| Literal meaning | \"China People Liberation Army\" |\n| | Transcriptions | | | --- | --- | | [Standard Mandarin](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_Chinese \"Standard Chinese\") | | | [Hanyu Pinyin](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanyu_Pinyin \"Hanyu Pinyin\") | Zhōngguó Rénmín Jiěfàngjūn | | [Bopomofo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bopomofo \"Bopomofo\") | ㄓㄨㄥ ㄍㄨㄛˊ ㄖㄣˊ ㄇㄧㄣˊ ㄐㄧㄝˇ ㄈㄤˋ ㄐㄩㄣ | | [Wade–Giles](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wade%E2%80%93Giles \"Wade–Giles\") | Chung1-kuo2 Jen2-min2 Chieh3-fang4-chün1 | | [Tongyong Pinyin](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tongyong_Pinyin \"Tongyong Pinyin\") | Jhong-guó Rén-mín Jiě-fàng-jyun | | [IPA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/Mandarin \"Help:IPA/Mandarin\") | [[ʈʂʊ́ŋ.kwǒ ɻə̌n.mǐn tɕjè.fǎŋ.tɕýn]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/Mandarin \"Help:IPA/Mandarin\") | | [Yue: Cantonese](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cantonese \"Cantonese\") | | | [Yale Romanization](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yale_romanization_of_Cantonese \"Yale romanization of Cantonese\") | Jūng-gwok Yàhn-màhn Gáai-fong-gwān | | [Jyutping](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jyutping \"Jyutping\") | zung1 gwok3 jan4 man4 gaai2 fong3 gwan1 | | [IPA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/Cantonese \"Help:IPA/Cantonese\") | [[tsʊŋ˥ kʷɔk̚˧ jɐn˩ mɐn˩ kaj˧˥ fɔŋ˧ kʷɐn˥]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/Cantonese \"Help:IPA/Cantonese\") | | |\n\nThe **People's Liberation Army** (**PLA**) is the military wing of the [Chinese Communist Party](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_Communist_Party \"Chinese Communist Party\") (CCP) and the primary armed forces of the [People's Republic of China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Republic_of_China \"People's Republic of China\") (PRC). It consists of four [services](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_branch \"Military branch\")—[Ground Force](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Ground_Force \"People's Liberation Army Ground Force\"), [Navy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Navy \"People's Liberation Army Navy\"), [Air Force](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Air_Force \"People's Liberation Army Air Force\"), and [Rocket Force](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Rocket_Force \"People's Liberation Army Rocket Force\")—and four arms—[Aerospace Force](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Aerospace_Force \"People's Liberation Army Aerospace Force\"), [Cyberspace Force](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Cyberspace_Force \"People's Liberation Army Cyberspace Force\"), [Information Support Force](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Information_Support_Force \"People's Liberation Army Information Support Force\"), and [Joint Logistics Support Force](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_Joint_Logistics_Support_Force \"People's Liberation Army Joint Logistics Support Force\"). It operates under the CCP's [absolute control](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Party_commands_the_gun \"The Party commands the gun\") and is led by the [Central Military Commission](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Central_Military_Commission_(China) \"Central Military Commission (China)\") (CMC) with its [chairman](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chairman_of_the_Central_Military_Commission_(China) \"Chairman of the Central Military Commission (China)\") as [commander-in-chief](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supreme_Military_Command_of_the_People's_Republic_of_China \"Supreme Military Command of the People's Republic of China\"). Alongside the paramilitary [People's Armed Police](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Armed_Police \"People's Armed Police\") (PAP) and the [Militia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Militia_(China) \"Militia (China)\"), the PLA forms the bulk of the country's armed forces.\n\nThe PLA can trace its origins during the [Republican era](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republic_of_China_(1912%E2%80%931949) \"Republic of China (1912–1949)\") to the left-wing units of the [National Revolutionary Army](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Revolutionary_Army \"National Revolutionary Army\") (NRA) of the [Kuomintang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kuomintang \"Kuomintang\") (KMT), when they broke away in 1927 in an [uprising](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nanchang_Uprising \"Nanchang Uprising\") against the [nationalist government](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nationalist_government \"Nationalist government\") as the [Chinese Red Army](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_Red_Army \"Chinese Red Army\") before being reintegrated into the NRA as units of [New Fourth Army](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Fourth_Army \"New Fourth Army\") and [Eighth Route Army](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eighth_Route_Army \"Eighth Route Army\") during the [Second Sino-Japanese War](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Sino-Japanese_War \"Second Sino-Japanese War\"). The two NRA communist units were reconstituted as the PLA in 1947. Since 1949, the PLA has used nine different military strategies, which it calls \"strategic guidelines\". The most important came in 1956, 1980, and 1993. Politically, the PLA and the PAP have the [largest delegation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Liberation_Army_and_People's_Armed_Police_delegation_to_the_National_People's_Congress \"People's Liberation Army and People's Armed Police delegation to the National People's Congress\") in the [National People's Congress](https://en.wiki\n\n<error>Content truncated. Call the fetch tool with a start_index of 15000 to get more content.</error>"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
