istan \"Tajikistan\") | [Dushanbe](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dushanbe \"Dushanbe\") | State visit and attendance to [14th meeting](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2014_Dushanbe_SCO_summit \"2014 Dushanbe SCO summit\") of the [Shanghai Cooperation Organisation](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shanghai_Cooperation_Organisation \"Shanghai Cooperation Organisation\").[[39]](#cite_note-39) |  |\n| 14–16 September | [Maldives](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maldives \"Maldives\") | [Malé](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malé \"Malé\") | [[40]](#cite_note-40) |  |\n| 16–17 September | [Sri Lanka](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sri_Lanka \"Sri Lanka\") | [Colombo](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colombo \"Colombo\") | [[41]](#cite_note-41) |  |\n| 17–19 September | [India](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/India \"India\") | [New Delhi](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Delhi \"New Delhi\") [Ahmedabad](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahmedabad \"Ahmedabad\") | State visit.[[42]](#cite_note-42) Met with Prime Minister [Narendra Modi](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narendra_Modi \"Narendra Modi\"). Visited New Delhi and also went to Modi's hometown in the state of [Gujarat](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gujarat \"Gujarat\").[[43]](#cite_note-india2-43) |  |\n| 7 | 14–19 November | [Australia](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australia \"Australia\") | [Brisbane](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brisbane \"Brisbane\"), [Sydney](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sydney \"Sydney\"), [Canberra](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canberra \"Canberra\"), [Hobart](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hobart \"Hobart\") | Xi Jinping became the third Chinese President to visit Australia, after his two predecessors. Xi Jinping first attended the [G20 Summit](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2014_G20\n\n<error>Content truncated. Call the fetch tool with a start_index of 15000 to get more content.</error>"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
