anila \"Manila\") | State visit[[107]](#cite_note-107) |  |\n| 4 | 27–29 November | [Spain](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spain \"Spain\") | [Madrid](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Madrid \"Madrid\") | Met with the King [Felipe VI](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felipe_VI_of_Spain \"Felipe VI of Spain\"), Prime Minister [Pedro Sánchez](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pedro_Sánchez \"Pedro Sánchez\") and speakers of the [Congress](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Congress_of_Deputies \"Congress of Deputies\") and [Senate](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Senate_of_Spain \"Senate of Spain\"). Multiple bilateral relationship issues were discussed, including an invitation for Spain to join the [Belt and Road Initiative](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belt_and_Road_Initiative \"Belt and Road Initiative\"). Agreements were signed addressing [double taxation](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Double_taxation \"Double taxation\"), scientific products or exports of Spanish food products.[[108]](#cite_note-108) |  |\n| 30 November–1 December | [Argentina](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argentina \"Argentina\") | [Buenos Aires](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buenos_Aires \"Buenos Aires\") | State visit and attendance to the [13th G20 summit](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_G20_Buenos_Aires_summit \"2018 G20 Buenos Aires summit\").[[109]](#cite_note-109) |  |\n| 3 December | [Panama](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panama \"Panama\") | [Panama City](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panama_City \"Panama City\") | [[110]](#cite_note-110) |  |\n| 4–5 December | [Portugal](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portugal \"Portugal\") | [Lisbon](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisbon \"Lisbon\") | [[111]](#cite_note-111) |  |\n\n|  | Dates | Country | Locations | Details | Image |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 22–24 March | [Italy](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italy \"Italy\") | [Rome](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rome \"Rome\") | [State visit](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_state_visits_by_Xi_Jinping_to_Italy_and_France \"2019 state visits by Xi Jinping to Italy and France\"). |  |\n| 24 March |